  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An ultra-precise, ultra-slim brow pencil perfect for creating the thinnest hair-like strokes for naturally-defined brows. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of sulfates SLS and SLES, parabens, phthalates, and triclosan, and contains less than one percent of synthetic fragrances. This product is also vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> With the thinnest 1.4-millimeter tip, this uniquely-shaped brow pencil gives you all the control with all the payoff.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Outline your desired brow shape and fill in any sparse areas using small strokes.<br>-Use brush on other end to blend and groom brows into place.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Polyethylene, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Copernicia Cerifera Wax, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Mica, Zinc Stearate, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Aluminum Hydroxide, Polybutene, Sorbitan Tristearate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499, Ci 77492, Ci 77491). <br><br>Ingredient lists and claims may change or vary from time to time as part of Hourglass’s commitment to innovation and maintaining global compliance. Please refer to the ingredient list on the product packaging you receive to ensure the ingredients are suitable for your personal use.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An ultra-precise, ultra-slim brow pencil perfect for creating the thinnest hair-like strokes for naturally-defined brows. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of sulfates SLS and SLES, parabens, phthalates, and triclosan, and contains less than one percent of synthetic fragrances. This product is also vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> With the thinnest 1.4-millimeter tip, this uniquely-shaped brow pencil gives you all the control with all the payoff.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Outline your desired brow shape and fill in any sparse areas using small strokes.<br>-Use brush on other end to blend and groom brows into place.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Polyethylene, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Copernicia Cerifera Wax, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Mica, Zinc Stearate, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Aluminum Hydroxide, Polybutene, Sorbitan Tristearate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499, Ci 77492, Ci 77491). <br><br>Ingredient lists and claims may change or vary from time to time as part of Hourglass’s commitment to innovation and maintaining global compliance. Please refer to the ingredient list on the product packaging you receive to ensure the ingredients are suitable for your personal use.</div></details>",
